          {
            "title": " <=",
            "id": 126513,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per verificare se un numero è minore o uguale a un altro numero, usiamo l'<strong>operatore minore o uguale</strong>, <code>&lt;=</code>.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &lt;= \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"10\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&lt;=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Check equality",
            "id": 126514,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Se il numero a sinistra è minore o uguale al numero a destra, come in <code>11 &lt;= 11</code>, il risultato è <code>true</code>.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &lt;= \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"14\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>11</code>, seguito da <code>&lt;=</code> e infine <code>11</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": ">=",
            "id": 126515,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per verificare se un numero è maggiore o uguale a un altro numero, usiamo l'<strong>operatore maggiore o uguale a</strong>, <code>&gt;=</code>.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"3099\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &gt;= \" /><text value=\"3099\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"13\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&gt;=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Storing",
            "id": 126516,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Analogamente all'assegnazione di un nuovo valore a una variabile, usiamo l'<strong>operatore di assegnazione</strong> per memorizzare il risultato di un confronto in una variabile.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &lt;= \" /><text value=\"15\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(result)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Compare variables",
            "id": 126517,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo anche usare un operatore di confronto per confrontare una variabile con un'altra variabile, come in <code>min &lt;= max</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"min\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\" = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"max\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\" = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"min\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\" &lt;= \" /><text value=\"max\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(result)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>min</code>, seguito da <code>&lt;=</code> e infine <code>max</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
